---
{
  title: "valid_user"
}
---
### NAME

    valid_user() - Returns 1 if the object is a valid user, 0 if not.

### SYNOPSIS

    varargs int valid_user( mixed ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Returns 1 if the object is a valid user, 0 if not.

### PARAMETERS

    ob  (mixed)
        The object to check.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the object is a valid user, otherwise 0.
